{"agent_id":"pp3g-aZJD-fix-435-agent-liveness-py-v2-file-scripts-agent-5690","agent_seq":4,"timestamp":"2026-08-23T23:34:58.018413303Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"547bd1ba-83cb-4e1d-8d17-513908ff9efb","comment_uuid":"9b97cdae-fe40-4e5b-a47c-3b744f95474d","author":"pp3g-aZJD-fix-435-agent-liveness-py-v2-file-scripts-agent-5690","content":"Plan: Rewrite scripts/agent-liveness.py to v2. (1) ACTIVITY: drop reflog entirely; activity = newest mtime via bounded scandir-recursion walk of the worktree excluding .git (depth<=6, entry-count ceiling), fallback = checkout baseline (max of .kickoff-metadata started_at, worktree root mtime); report winning source walk|baseline. Rationale: .git excluded kills Bug-A (global hydration/reflog churn); per-worktree .crosslink stays IN the walk because reviewer comments/syncs are genuine agent activity and infra writes land in the shared gitdir/main checkout, not worktrees. (2) ALIVENESS probe per agent: tmux list-panes (-F pane_dead/pane_pid) -> missing session = SESSION-GONE; pane_dead=1 OR process-tree scan of pane_pid descendants (via ps -eo pid,ppid,comm) showing only shells = EXITED; any non-shell descendant = ALIVE. Verified live: zombie bxXr tree=bare bash, live rChm tree=bash->timeout->opencode->node. (3) VERDICT MATRIX: DONE+gone/exited=DONE-CONFIRMED; ALIVE+fresh=RUNNING-ALIVE; ALIVE+stale(>=2x budget)=STALE-SUSPECT; gone-or-exited+RUNNING/ABSENT+role in {reviewer,auditor,orchestrator}=FINISHED-UNMARKABLE (#434); gone-or-exited+RUNNING/ABSENT+other/unknown-role=DEAD-UNMARKED (zombie). Role sourced from full-scrollback regex --agent '<role>' (survives process exit while session lingers; verified on bxXr); unknown when session gone. Pane-hash freeze kept as overlay: identical consecutive hashes upgrades to LIKELY-FROZEN. (4) FLAGS: keep --pane/--json/--budget-min/--state-dir; add --all (pane-hash every ALIVE session in one pass). Table gains ALIVENESS+ROLE columns, severity-sorted. Stdlib only; writes only --state-dir; touch only this script.","created_at":"2026-08-23T23:34:58.008911435Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:ZANX5Q3iuy358pmM0Mri8BEWb3jdrPCw+y+r4qf1qV8","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+Vcs+fa9aGr8Vr3zwAzWMPHEDN3THqE3BZG0rqNqZk4AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAtMctpJ0kAd72Ur4Xl9hKx9TUbBtsLFZ8+N5p+lRDRv7F9asU1qdAfo9WbDxjlPQ1GoiGTVCTu63dpO5FV9utBQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:ZANX5Q3iuy358pmM0Mri8BEWb3jdrPCw+y+r4qf1qV8","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+Vcs+fa9aGr8Vr3zwAzWMPHEDN3THqE3BZG0rqNqZk4AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNYdG11+yWYADp9Q8HZaZU54FTG7cKZs9bpqpvl2WhMLuhPZ0Ve83gATIpdxbEL3eqiJVWQJ1FAdwEQOE/9cZg8="}
